     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,255)\">Hi all.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,255)\">Maybe it&#39;s irrelevant. But I think the digest might want to mention that, Hadley Wickham, the author who created ggplot2, dplyr, tidyverse, etc, had just won the COPSS Presidents&#39; Award at the 2019 Joint Statistical Meeting (JSM) in Denver, CO on July 31.. The COPSS Presidents&#39; Award, by the way, is what we statisticians call &quot;Nobel Prize of Statistics&quot;.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><a href=\"https://www.stat.iastate.edu/hadley-wickham-isu-alum-receives-cops-award\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.stat.iastate.edu/hadley-wickham-isu-alum-receives-cops-award&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366290924000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3E6mes80oJeW-g1L8n6TZF\">https://www.stat.iastate.edu/hadley-wickham-isu-alum-receives-cops-award</a></font><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">Congratulations to Hadley!</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">Yanlei</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><br></div></div></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Jul 31, 2019 at 10:38 AM &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:18px;line-height:20px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/ggplot2/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(51,51,51)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/ggplot2/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366290924000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PJm_ECFUciOv0f67XhitP\">\r\n              ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:24px;font-family:arial\"><a style=\"color:rgb(221,75,57);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366290924000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12chhI80GKTYJ9sOAEt2d_\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366290924000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12chhI80GKTYJ9sOAEt2d_\"><img style=\"border:0px;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_1980275196372059363_m_-20738059414247365_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n  \r\n    Topic digest\r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/ggplot2/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/ggplot2/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366290924000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PJm_ECFUciOv0f67XhitP\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_1980275196372059363_m_-20738059414247365_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Rocks Cluster 7, gcc 7.2.0, R 3.5.2</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119)\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_1980275196372059363_m_-20738059414247365_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0px 5px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/t/ddd9356a9aba7747?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/t/ddd9356a9aba7747?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366290924000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3dXPu0lour9Ll03pzG4Zqz\">\r\n      Rocks Cluster 7, gcc 7.2.0, R 3.5.2\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n      <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211)\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n          Surraj Jadhav &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sun...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jul 30 08:22PM +0530\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        Awesome, thanks!<br>\r\nAll of you were correct. Took sometime for me to understand though.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nI had compiled the SDSC rolls (R, gcc, etc.) on Oracle Virtual Machine for<br>\r\nPOC and simply used the same ISOs for the cluster build on actual IBM x3650<br>\r\nHardware.<br>\r\nLooks like all rolls need to be recompiled on the actual cluster hardware<br>\r\nto ensure compatibility with the hardware &amp; software.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThat is how i am looking at it since I have limited knowledge of this whole<br>\r\ncompiling things.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThanks for your replies and suggestions as I was not hopeful to hear on<br>\r\nthis so soon.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nOn Mon, Jul 29, 2019 at 9:07 PM Marek Gagolewski &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ma...@gagolewski.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\nwrote:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nThanks &amp; Regards<br>\r\nSurraj Jadhav<br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_1980275196372059363_m_-20738059414247365_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(99,99,99);font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/ggplot2/join\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/ggplot2/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366290924000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AkoOO4BH9axSOluImHFhc\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr></tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
